## Verification

The font licences are the `*-OFL.txt` files shipped beside each font. Taken as
stated facts (not independently verified here): the MIT licensing of
faster-whisper, CTranslate2 and the Whisper weights; the CC-BY-4.0 licensing of the
Parakeet weights (the Core ML and ONNX builds are format conversions, and Ultra and Redux were trained
further by Moondream: the credit above is the attribution the licence asks for); the licences declared by
the Rust crates; and Debian's FFmpeg build being GPLv2+.
